msgid "Type: \"Push API Check\""
msgstr "Type: \"Push API Check\""

#: ../../monitoring/checks.rst:75
msgid ""
"Copy the curl command are schedule to send this via your API. For testing"
" we used postman to send the api call at an interval of 4 mins."
msgstr "Copiez la commande curl et planifiez son envoi via votre API. Pour les tests, nous avons utilisé postman pour envoyer l'appel API à un intervalle de 4 minutes."

#: ../../monitoring/checks.rst:79
msgid "MySQL Check"
